<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device">
  <diagram name="1. Modules &amp; Functions" id="1.-modules-&amp;-functions">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2600" pageHeight="1342" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="c1" value="&lt;b&gt;VectorFlow — Low Level Design: Every Module, Class and Function&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=22;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2300" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;app/config.py&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;configuration&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;class Settings(BaseSettings)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;All runtime configuration. env_prefix=VF_, reads .env, ignores unknown keys. Fields: es_url, es_api_key, es_index, es_timeout_seconds=10, es_startup_retries=30, redis_url, embedding_model, embedding_device=cpu, embedding_batch_size=64, query_prefix, document_prefix, query_cache_size=4096, num_candidates_factor=10, session_ttl_seconds=1800, session_context_weight=0.3, session_decay=0.6, session_history_size=20, session_max_seen=500.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;get_settings() -&amp;gt; Settings&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;@lru_cache singleton: parses the environment once and returns the same Settings instance.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="520" height="222" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;app/main.py&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;application factory &amp;amp; lifecycle&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;create_app(settings=None, *, embedder=None, store=None, sessions=None) -&amp;gt; FastAPI&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Builds the FastAPI app. Any component can be injected (tests do this); otherwise each is built from Settings. Registers lifespan, the timing middleware and the API router.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;lifespan(app)  [async context manager, nested]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Startup per worker, using AsyncExitStack for cleanup:&lt;br&gt;1) load HFEmbedder in a thread pool; 2) create AsyncElasticsearch, register close(), wait_until_ready(); 3) store.ensure_index(); 4) RedisSessionStore if redis_url else InMemorySessionStore, register close(); 5) warm-up embed; 6) publish settings/embedder/store/sessions on app.state. On shutdown or failed startup, clients are closed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;response_time_header(request, call_next)  [HTTP middleware]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Measures wall time around the request and sets X-Response-Time-Ms (2 dp).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;app = create_app()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Module-level ASGI app used by uvicorn (app.main:app).&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="326" width="520" height="318" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;app/schemas.py&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Pydantic request/response models&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;DocumentIn&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;id?: str, title?: str, text: str (min 1), metadata: dict = {}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;IndexRequest / IndexResponse&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;documents: list[DocumentIn] (1–1000), refresh = true  →  indexed, failed, ids, took_ms&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;SearchRequest&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;query (1–2048), k = 10 (1–100), session_id?, filters?: dict[str, scalar | list[scalar]], use_context = true, exclude_seen = false&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;SearchHit / Timings / SearchResponse&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;id, score, title, text, metadata · embed_ms, search_ms, total_ms · query, session_id, context_applied, hits, timings&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;SessionOut&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;id, created_at, updated_at, queries, seen_count, has_context&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;HealthResponse&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;status, elasticsearch, sessions, model, documents?&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="668" width="520" height="314" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;app/api.py&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;HTTP routes (APIRouter)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;_ms(start, end) -&amp;gt; float&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Converts a perf_counter interval to milliseconds rounded to 2 dp.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;_services(request) -&amp;gt; (Settings, Embedder, VectorStore, SessionStore)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fetches the singletons placed on app.state by lifespan.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;_session_out(session) -&amp;gt; SessionOut&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Maps the internal Session to its API shape: seen_count = len(seen_ids), has_context = context is not None.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;GET /health  health(request, response) -&amp;gt; HealthResponse&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;store.ping() + sessions.ping(); store.count() when ES is up. Sets 503 and status &quot;degraded&quot; if either is down.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;POST /documents  index_documents(body: IndexRequest, request) -&amp;gt; IndexResponse&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;model_dump() docs, builds text &quot;title. text&quot;, embed_documents() in thread pool, store.index_documents(refresh=body.refresh), returns indexed/failed/ids/took_ms.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;DELETE /documents/{doc_id}  delete_document(doc_id, request)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;store.delete(); 204 on success, 404 if it did not exist.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;POST /search  search(body: SearchRequest, request) -&amp;gt; SearchResponse&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1) load session if session_id (404 if missing); 2) embed_query in thread pool; 3) context_applied = session and use_context and session.context; blend_query(weight=session_context_weight); 4) store.search(k, num_candidates=k×num_candidates_factor, filters, exclude_ids=seen_ids if exclude_seen); 5) record_query + sessions.save; 6) build response with timings embed/search/total.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;POST /sessions  create_session(request) -&amp;gt; SessionOut  [201]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;sessions.create().&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;GET /sessions/{session_id}  get_session(...) -&amp;gt; SessionOut&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;404 if missing or expired.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;DELETE /sessions/{session_id}  delete_session(...)  [204]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;404 if missing or expired.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="700" y="80" width="520" height="522" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;tests/&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;test doubles &amp;amp; suites (pytest)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;FakeEmbedder&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bag-of-words hashing into 256 dims; texts sharing words get similar vectors. No torch.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;FakeVectorStore&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Brute-force cosine with the same filter / exclude semantics and score scale as ES.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;SlowModel + make_embedder()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fake SentenceTransformer used to test micro-batching, cache and error propagation.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;test_api.py · test_sessions.py · test_embeddings.py&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Endpoints, validation, filters, sessions (context steering, exclude_seen), maths, serialisation, TTL, batching. 18 tests.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="700" y="626" width="520" height="261" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;app/embeddings.py&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Hugging Face embedding service&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;class Embedder(Protocol)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Interface: dim, model_name, embed_query(text), embed_documents(texts). Lets tests inject a fake.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;class HFEmbedder&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;sentence-transformers implementation. All vectors float32 and L2-normalised (cosine == dot).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;__init__(model_name, device='cpu', batch_size=64, query_prefix='', document_prefix='', cache_size=4096)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lazily imports sentence_transformers (keeps torch out of tests), loads the model, reads dim (get_embedding_dimension / get_sentence_embedding_dimension), creates _model_lock, _pending queue + _pending_lock, and wraps _encode_query in an lru_cache.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;_run_model(texts) -&amp;gt; ndarray[n, dim]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;model.encode(normalize_embeddings=True, convert_to_numpy=True, batch_size, no progress bar) → float32. No locking.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;_encode(texts) -&amp;gt; ndarray&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;_run_model under _model_lock (one forward pass at a time per worker).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;_encode_query(text) -&amp;gt; ndarray[dim]  (micro-batching)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Enqueue (prefix+text, Future); acquire _model_lock; if own Future not yet done, drain the whole queue and encode it in one pass, resolving every Future (or set_exception on all). Vectors are made read-only because they are shared through the cache.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;embed_query(text) -&amp;gt; ndarray&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Public entry: LRU-cached _encode_query.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;embed_documents(texts) -&amp;gt; ndarray[n, dim]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Adds document_prefix, encodes in chunks of batch_size, lock taken per chunk so queries interleave; concatenates.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;cache_info() -&amp;gt; {hits, misses, size}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Query-cache statistics.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1360" y="80" width="520" height="531" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;app/sessions.py&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;stateful search sessions&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;_normalize(v) -&amp;gt; ndarray&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;v / ||v|| as float32 (zero vector returned unchanged).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;@dataclass Session&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;id, created_at, updated_at, queries: list[str], seen_ids: list[str], context: ndarray | None.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;Session.new() -&amp;gt; Session&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;uuid4 hex id, created_at = updated_at = now.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;Session.to_json() -&amp;gt; str&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;JSON; context stored as base64 of float32 bytes (compact, lossless).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;Session.from_json(raw) -&amp;gt; Session&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Inverse of to_json; decodes context back into a float32 array.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;blend_query(query_vec, context, weight) -&amp;gt; ndarray&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Returns query_vec unchanged if no context or weight ≤ 0; else normalize((1−w)·q + w·context).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;record_query(session, query, query_vec, result_ids, decay, history_size, max_seen)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;In place: context = q (first query) or normalize(decay·context + (1−decay)·q); queries keeps last history_size; seen_ids is an ordered set (re-seen ids move to the end) trimmed to max_seen; updated_at = now.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;class SessionStore(Protocol)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;create, get, save, delete, ping, close.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;class InMemorySessionStore(ttl_seconds)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;dict id → (expires_at, json). get() lazily evicts expired entries; save() resets expiry. Single process only.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;class RedisSessionStore(url, ttl_seconds, prefix='vf:session:')&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;redis.asyncio client. _key(id) = prefix + id; create = new + save; get = GET + from_json; save = SET EX ttl (sliding TTL); delete = DEL &amp;gt; 0; ping = PING (exceptions → False); close = aclose().&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1360" y="635" width="520" height="522" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;app/store.py&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Elasticsearch vector store&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;class VectorStore(Protocol)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Interface: ensure_index, index_documents, delete, search, count, ping.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;_as_keyword(value) -&amp;gt; str&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Flattened fields index leaves as keyword strings: bool → &quot;true&quot;/&quot;false&quot;, others str().&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;build_filter(filters, exclude_ids) -&amp;gt; dict&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;bool query: filter = [term metadata.&amp;lt;k&amp;gt;] for scalars / [terms metadata.&amp;lt;k&amp;gt;] for lists; must_not = [ids exclude_ids] when given. Used as the knn pre-filter.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;class ElasticVectorStore(client, index, dim)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Holds AsyncElasticsearch client, index name and vector dim.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;wait_until_ready(retries=30, delay=2.0)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Polls cluster.health(wait_for_status=yellow); on ConnectionError sleeps and retries; RuntimeError when exhausted.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;ensure_index()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Create the index if missing, then read its mapping and raise if embedding.dims != model dim; finally wait for index health yellow (30 s).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;_create_index()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;indices.create: 1 shard, 0 replicas, refresh 1s; mapping title/text=text, metadata=flattened, created_at=date, embedding=dense_vector(dim, cosine, int8_hnsw m=16 ef_construction=100). Swallows resource_already_exists_exception (multi-worker race).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;index_documents(docs, vectors, refresh=False) -&amp;gt; (ids, failed)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Assigns uuid4 hex ids where missing, stamps created_at (UTC ISO), builds bulk actions, async_bulk(raise_on_error=False, refresh=wait_for if requested). Returns successful ids and failure count; logs first failures.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;delete(doc_id) -&amp;gt; bool&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;client.delete(refresh=wait_for, ignore 404); True if result == &quot;deleted&quot;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;search(vector, k, num_candidates, filters=None, exclude_ids=None) -&amp;gt; list[dict]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;knn{field: embedding, query_vector, k, num_candidates=max(nc, k), filter=build_filter(...)}, size=k, source_excludes=[embedding]. Maps hits → {id, score, title, text, metadata}.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;count() -&amp;gt; int&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Document count of the index.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;ping() -&amp;gt; bool&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;client.ping(); any exception → False.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2020" y="80" width="520" height="647" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;scripts/ingest.py&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;bulk loader (HTTP client)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;read_jsonl(path) -&amp;gt; Iterator[dict]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Yields one document per non-empty JSONL line.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;read_hf(name, split, text_field, title_field, limit) -&amp;gt; Iterator[dict]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Streams a Hugging Face dataset; id = &amp;lt;name&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;split&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;i&amp;gt;; scalar non-text columns become metadata.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;batched(it, size) -&amp;gt; Iterator[list[dict]]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Chunks an iterator into lists of size (last may be shorter).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;main()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Args: --jsonl | --hf-dataset, --split, --text-field, --title-field, --limit, --batch-size 256, --api. POSTs each batch with refresh=false, prints running count and docs/s, exits 1 if any failed.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2020" y="751" width="520" height="246" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;scripts/benchmark.py&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;latency / throughput benchmark&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;pct(values, p) -&amp;gt; float&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nearest-rank percentile.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;run(args)  [async]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;httpx.AsyncClient; optional shared session; semaphore limits concurrency; warm-up requests then reset stats; gathers N requests; prints throughput and p50/p95/p99/mean for client latency and server embed/search/total.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;one(i)  [nested async]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Builds a query (unique suffix unless --allow-cache), times POST /search, records server timings, counts errors.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a3d7c&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;main()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Args: --api, --requests 500, --concurrency 8, --k 10, --warmup 20, --session, --allow-cache.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2020" y="1021" width="520" height="261" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
